    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but its not just like a normal mistake. it feels different. like it's just who i am at my core. i feel like i've fundamentally broken something that can't be fixed. i just feel so heavy and like i'm just a burden to everyone. like i'm just taking up space that someone better deserves.",
